Maintainer: Stephan February <stephan.february@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/stephanfeb/go-ricochet
Description: Ricochet Store-and-Forward Server (Go)
 A P2P message store-and-forward server built in Go with PostgreSQL backend.
 Provides reliable message delivery for offline peers in P2P networks.
 .
 Features:
  - PostgreSQL-backed persistent storage
  - libp2p networking with GossipSub and DHT
  - Support for private, shared, and public mailboxes
  - Document store with versioning
  - User directory with full-text search
  - Push-based presence signaling
  - Message prioritization and retention policies
  - End-to-end encryption and LZ4 compression
